license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/jesusalzate/Radiomics-Prostate-Cancer"  # TODO: confirm URL
keywords:
  - radiomics
  - prostate cancer
  - multiparametric MRI
  - machine learning
  - deep learning
  - csPCa
abstract: >-
  A reproducible workflow for detecting clinically significant prostate cancer
  (csPCa, ISUP grade group >= 2) from multiparametric prostate MRI radiomics
  features, clinical variables, and combined tabular models, evaluated with
  patient-grouped cross-validation, leakage-safe feature selection, calibrated
  probabilities, and patient-level bootstrap confidence intervals on the PI-CAI
  cohort.
